  "notes": [
    "Each of the 15 slots is optional. The agency specifies the documents, filenames and sequence for its opportunity.",
    "The definition keeps the numbered slots used in SGG. A file in slot 15 is written to ATT15/ATT15File even when earlier slots are empty.",
    "No answers are pre- or post-populated. The application assigns an ID to each uploaded file."
